Instrução: Conectar as partes do sistema via hooks, chamadas entre classes e rotas REST. Sem lógica de negócio — apenas wiring. Cada método recebe chamadas reais mas retorna valores neutros (null, [], false, 0). Seguir exatamente as conexões abaixo.

--- includes/class-wc-bridge.php — método init() ---
Corpo do método init():
  add_action('woocommerce_before_calculate_totals', array(__CLASS__, 'inject_dynamic_price'), 20);
  add_filter('woocommerce_cart_item_name', array(__CLASS__, 'set_cart_item_name'), 10, 3);
  add_action('woocommerce_checkout_create_order_line_item', array(__CLASS__, 'set_order_item_meta'), 10, 4);

--- includes/class-api.php — método init() ---
Corpo do método init():
  add_action('rest_api_init', array(__CLASS__, 'register_routes'));

--- includes/class-api.php — método register_routes() ---
Corpo do método register_routes():
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/packs', array(
    'methods'             => 'GET',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'get_packs'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'public_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/packs', array(
    'methods'             => 'POST',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'create_pack'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'admin_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/packs/(?P<id>\d+)', array(
    'methods'             => 'PUT',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'update_pack'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'admin_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/packs/(?P<id>\d+)', array(
    'methods'             => 'DELETE',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'delete_pack'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'admin_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/session', array(
    'methods'             => 'POST',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'create_session'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'public_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/session/(?P<token>[a-f0-9]+)', array(
    'methods'             => 'GET',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'get_session'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'public_permission'),
  ));
  register_rest_route(CC_PACKS_API_NS, '/session/(?P<id>\d+)/status', array(
    'methods'             => 'POST',
    'callback'            => array(__CLASS__, 'update_session_status'),
    'permission_callback' => array(__CLASS__, 'admin_permission'),
  ));

Nota: adicionar também as assinaturas ausentes na classe CC_Packs_API:
  public static function create_pack(object $request): object
  public static function update_pack(object $request): object
  public static function delete_pack(object $request): object
  public static function update_session_status(object $request): object

--- admin/class-admin-page.php — método __construct() ---
Corpo do __construct():
  $this->register_shortcode();
  add_action('wp_enqueue_scripts', array($this, 'enqueue_assets'));

--- admin/class-admin-page.php — método register_shortcode() ---
Corpo do método:
  add_shortcode('cc_packs_admin', array($this, 'render'));

--- admin/class-admin-page.php — método render() ---
Corpo do método:
  if ( ! $this->check_access() ) return '';
  $mode = isset($_GET['cc_mode']) && $_GET['cc_mode'] === 'orders' ? 'orders' : 'crud';
  if ( $mode === 'orders' ) return $this->render_orders_mode();
  return $this->render_crud_mode();

--- admin/class-admin-page.php — método check_access() ---
Corpo do método:
  return current_user_can('manage_options');

--- public/class-store-page.php — método __construct() ---
Corpo do __construct():
  $this->register_shortcode();
  add_action('wp_enqueue_scripts', array($this, 'enqueue_assets'));

--- public/class-store-page.php — método register_shortcode() ---
Corpo do método:
  add_shortcode('cc_packs_store', array($this, 'render'));

--- plugin-packs-chama-coins.php — função cc_packs_init() ---
Corpo da função:
  new CC_Packs_Admin_Page();
  new CC_Packs_Store_Page();
  CC_Packs_WC_Bridge::init();
  CC_Packs_API::init();

Verificação: Confirmar que (1) CC_Packs_WC_Bridge::init() registra os 3 hooks WC, (2) CC_Packs_API::register_routes() registra 7 rotas REST, (3) as 4 novas assinaturas foram adicionadas em class-api.php, (4) __construct() de ambas as pages registra shortcode e enqueue, (5) render() de CC_Packs_Admin_Page checa acesso e despacha por modo, (6) cc_packs_init() instancia e inicializa os 4 componentes.
